{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2024-02/1066123/block/singleImage/3280242/df/%E9%87%8D%E6%85%B6.jpg?updatedAt=1795763545\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀重慶大廈。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>尖沙咀重慶大廈發生墮樓案。 今日（27日）下午1時37分，一名右肩有紋身圖案的男子倒臥於尖沙咀重慶大廈天井，有住客懷疑他由高處墮下，於是報警求助。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，發現男子已經陷入昏迷，救護員即場為他急救，再由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。警方正在調查其身分及墮樓原因。事故期間大廈的鹹水喉被壓爛，有鹹水溢出。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:44:14.202940+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T07:12:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:57:14.697450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:37:23.037323+00:00","content_hash":"baf7ad02ec56d0c1d888bd7741ff134d6ffb8be63d33c3c7a1789f526e7b98b4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:44:14.202940+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}